---
import DocsLayout from "../../layouts/DocsLayout.astro";
---

<DocsLayout title="Install dollarlint" current="/guides/installation/">
  <article class="doc">
    <header class="doc-header">
      <span class="eyebrow">Guide</span>
      <h1>Installation</h1>
      <p class="lead">Install the dollarlint command with Go, then run it from any project that contains JSON, YAML, or TOML config files.</p>
    </header>

    <h2>Install with Go</h2>
    <pre><code>go install github.com/agorischek/dollarlint/cmd/dollarlint@latest</code></pre>

    <h2>Check the command</h2>
    <pre><code>dollarlint version
dollarlint --help</code></pre>

    <div class="note">
      <p>The CLI expects commands such as <code>dollarlint validate .</code>. Bare paths are not accepted.</p>
    </div>
  </article>
</DocsLayout>
